    "title": "Data release for GWTC-5.0: Tests of General Relativity",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21454847",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-22",
    "description": "<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">This is the data release for the paper GWTC-5.0: Tests of General Relativity. Included are the data products necessary to reproduce the figures in the paper using results from the following ananalysis pipelines:</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">- FTI_TIGER: Flexible Theory-Independent test / Test Infrastructure for GEneral Relativity post-inspiral analysis</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">- POL: test for non-GR polarizations</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">- pSEOB: full-signal parameterized ringdown test of BBH merger remnants</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">- QNMRF: Quasi-Normal Mode Rational Filter (ringdown test of BBH merger remnants)</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">- RD: post-merger ringdown test of BBH merger remnants</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">- RES: residual test</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">The `.tar.gz` file associated with each analysis contains the data required to run the plotting scripts/notebooks and specific plotting environments where necessary, alongside a README file with instructions.</span></p>",
